2. (1) In these Rules unless the context otherwise requires ;

"The Act" means the Federation of Malaya Rubber Exchange
(Incorporation) Act, 196);

"Alternative Representative' means a person appointed under
Rule 47 by a corporation which is an Ordinary Member to represent
such Member at meetings in the absence of the Authorised Represen-
tative of such Member;

"Alternate Director" means a person appointed by the Board to act
as such under Rule 73;

"Annual General Meeting" means a General Meeting duly convened
under Rule 26;

"Associate Member" means a Member registered in that Category
under the Rules;

"Auditor" means the person appointed to be the Auditor for the
time being under the Rules;

"Authorised Representative' means a person appointed under
Rule 47 by a corporation which is an Ordinary Member to represent
such Member at meetings of the Corporation;

"The Board" means the Bead ot Directors constituted under the
Act;

"Broker" means a Member who is registered as a member of tho
Brokers Class constituted under the Rules;

