"Joint Members" means any two or more persons carrying on
business in partnership and elected to join membership under the
Rules;

"Manufacturers' Buying Agent" means a Member who is registered
as a member of the Manufacturers' Buying Agents Class constituted
under the Rules;

"Member" means a person whose name appears in the Register as
a member in any Class or Category and includes any two or more
persons whose names ate registered together as Joint Members;

"Ordinary Director" means any Director other than a Class Repre-
sentative ;

"Ordinary Member" means a Member registered in that Category
under section 7 of the Act and the Rules;

"Overseas Member" means a Member registered in that Category
under the Rules;

"person" means an individual and any corporation but does not
include a partnership firm or other unincorporated body or association;

"Principal Office" means the principal office established pursuant
to section 4 of the Act;

"Producer" means a Member who is registered as a member of the
Producers' Class constituted under the Rules;

"Register" means the register of Members established pursuant to
section 9 of the Act and the Rules;

"Regulations" means any regulations made by the Board pursuant
to the powers conferred by the Act and the Rules;

"Rubber" means rubber produced only from latex of the Hevea
Brasiliensis tree;

"Rubber Producers Council" means the Rubber Producers Council
of the Federation of Malaya;

"Rules" means these rules and any amendments, alterations and
additions thereto for the time being in force;

"Secretary" means the person or firm appointed to be the Secretary
for the time being under Rule 86;

"Settlement House" means any settlement house established
pursuant to the Act and the Rules and includes any joint settlement
house established as aforesaid by the Corporation jointly with any
trade association.

(2) Save as otherwise provided by the Act or by the Rules, bye-laws
or regulations, the Interpretation and General Clauses Ordinance, 1948,
shall apply in the construction and interpretation of these Rules and of
any bye-laws or regulations.

